    "excerpt": "My name is Samir Dautovic. I was born in Bosnia and Herzegovina and have lived in USA since 1996. Some facts about me: My first computer was Compaq Deskpro 4000 MMX 233MHz,\u2026",
    "content": "<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile is-vertically-aligned-top\" style=\"grid-template-columns:30% auto\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"/assets/img/me.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3224 size-full\" /></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:100%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\">\n<p>My name is Samir Dautovic. I was born in Bosnia and Herzegovina and have lived in USA since 1996. Some facts about me:</p>\n\n\n\n<p>My first computer was Compaq Deskpro 4000 MMX 233MHz, acquired in 1998 and retired in 2005.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>I think the internet is one of the greatest inventions, after wheel and writing.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>I must remember to never discuss politics, religion and guns online.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>More to come...</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons has-custom-font-size has-small-font-size\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/page.html?slug=contact-2\">Contact</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>",
